 update` installs 2.6.17 again. Sorry for the trouble!\r\n\r\n**Your instance is broken after `make update`?** Run these commands in the wallabag folder:\r\n\r\n```\r\ngit checkout 2.6.17 --force\r\nmake update\r\n```\r\n\r\nYour data should be safe: the upgrade stopped before the database migrations.\r\n\r\nThis release also includes a small fix for the Pocket CSV import.\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/wallabag/wallabag/compare/2.6.16...2.6.17","is_prerelease":false},"readme":true,"readme_zh":false,"news":[],"stale":false,"snapshot_at":"2026-11-14T08:50:43Z","history_start":"2026-09-06"}